{
  "id": "minimax-h3-taomate-pack",
  "name": "Community — MiniMax H3 (TaoMate 3-Step)",
  "version": "1.0.4",
  "author": "Alibaba TaoLive AIGC Team (LoRA); Kijai (ComfyUI conversion)",
  "nsfw": false,
  "description": "Alibaba TaoLive's TaoMate-H3 three-step distillation LoRA on the standard MiniMax H3 FL2VA weights. Three sampling steps instead of twenty, no classifier-free guidance, Euler. Text and image to video only; the LoRA stops using reference pictures, so there is no reference-to-video card. WHAT IT IS FOR. Bake 2026-09-16 on a 12 GB RTX 4070 Ti against the Turbo Accelerated pack at its default ten steps, same seeds and prompts, 5 s at 480p: a talking head rendered in 50 s against 83 s and came out sharper (Laplacian 46 vs 29) with the line verbatim and the mouth closing on the last word; a product turntable was a draw; a beach run lost sharpness (58 vs 102) and motion (frame-to-frame energy 4.5 vs 7.2), the dog smearing and the strides shortening. So: dialogue, presenters, product and other low-motion shots. Keep the turbo packs for action. Same base weights as the MiniMax H3 pack, so with that installed only the 173 MB LoRA downloads. Kijai's rank-19 averaged conversion of the official rank-128 adapter; MiniMax H3 community licence.",
  "tags": [
    "3-Step",
    "Distill",
    "I2V",
    "Local",
    "MiniMax H3",
    "T2V",
    "Talking head",
    "Video"
  ],
